  "title": "AIRO’s RQ-35 Heidrun ISR Drone Added To U.S. Blue UAS List",
  "summary": "MCLEAN, Va.–(BUSINESS WIRE)– AIRO Group Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: AIRO)(“AIRO” or the “Company”), a next-generation aerospace and defense company, today announced that its RQ-35 Heidrun, developed through its drone brand, Sky-Watch, has been granted Blue UAS status by the Defense Contract Management Agency (DCMA). With this approval, the RQ-35 is recognized by the Department of War (DoW) […]",
